// expect: 42
// mn-world-resume-frozen — the world-as-value arc's R4+A4 gate: a MultiShot
// remainder performs an evidence-tier op whose handler was installed by a
// DRIVERLESS install the yield crossed. Sound iff BOTH halves hold: the k
// record freezes the live world at reify (R4 — scaler's chain node rides
// the record) AND the driverless-install crossing composes instead of
// flooring (the A4 un-flooring: the frozen world is exactly the evidence
// the floor existed to protect, so the crossing's reason to floor is gone).
//
// MEASURED RED twice on the pre-arc pins: exit 134 (the k2 loud floor
// fires in main at the scaler crossing before any perform runs), then —
// with A4 un-floored but the perform still reading the bracket-restored
// state global — exit 30 (the remainder's emitt read the null page as its
// config: (10+0) + (20+0), silent). GREEN = 42: chooser resumes 10 and
// 20; the remainder under scaler(2) gives (10+6) + (20+6).
//
// scaler takes a config param (bare name — an annotated handler config
// param is unparsed lathe-lag) so emitt dispatches through the EVIDENCE
// tier (the world walk); a no-config singleton would direct-call past the
// chain and prove nothing.

effect Pick { pick() -> Int }
effect Emitt { emitt(n: Int) -> Int }

handler chooser {
  pick() => resume(10) + resume(20)
}

handler scaler(f) {
  emitt(n) => resume(n * f)
}

fn stage() = pick() + emitt(3)

fn main() = ({ stage() } ~> scaler(2)) ~> chooser
